Licensing of this repository
============================

This repository is data, and it is not under one licence. Each file carries the
licence of the source it derives from; see NOTICE for the sources, the licence
of each, and why files under incompatible licences are never merged.

  ranks.txt      CC BY-SA 4.0   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
  readings.txt   CC BY-SA 4.0   (Mandarin only; derived from CC-CEDICT)
  lemmas.txt     ODbL 1.0       https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
  lex.txt        all rights reserved
  gloss.*.txt    all rights reserved
  phrases.txt    all rights reserved
  sample.txt     all rights reserved

The glosses in gloss.*.txt are generated by this project from a word list alone.
They are not copied or translated from any licensed dictionary or corpus, are
not covered by the licences above, and are not offered under an open licence:
all rights reserved.

A word's frequency band is a bucketed corpus rank and is therefore derived from
the CC BY-SA data. It is computed from ranks.txt at load time rather than stored
in lex.txt, so that no file mixes the two positions.

Each file repeats its attribution in a `#` header so that the licence travels
with the file wherever it is copied to.
